      "RobotTelemetryOut": {
        "description": "单台机器人最新遥测（与 `state_cache._decode()` 的返回逐字段一致）。\n\n来源是 Redis Hash `robot:state:{robot_id}` 经 `_decode()` 还原类型后的 dict\n（`backend_ingestion/app/services/state_cache.py`）。\n注意 `joint_positions` 必须在这份契约里 —— 它正是 STATUS.md §六第 2 条\n那次事故（Drawer 第三条折线恒空）缺的字段。\n\n`is_online` / `last_seen` 是 ISSUE #77 追加的两个**新增可选字段**（非 breaking：\n老前端不读即忽略）。它们的来源不是遥测 Hash，而是 `app/services/liveness.py`\n的接收侧台账，由 `state_cache.snapshot()` 批量补齐。",
        "properties": {
          "battery_pct": {
            "title": "Battery Pct",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "error_code": {
            "default": 0,
            "title": "Error Code",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "is_online": {
            "default": false,
            "description": "后端判定：距最后一次收到遥测是否在阈值内（ISSUE #77）",
            "title": "Is Online",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "joint_positions": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "title": "Joint Positions",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "joint_temperatures": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "title": "Joint Temperatures",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "joint_torques": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "title": "Joint Torques",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "last_seen": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "最后一次收到该机器人遥测的 epoch 秒；从未上报为 null",
            "title": "Last Seen"
          },
          "max_joint_temp": {
            "title": "Max Joint Temp",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "robot_id": {
            "title": "Robot Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status_code": {
            "description": "0 离线 / 1 正常 / 2 预警 / 3 故障",
            "title": "Status Code",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "ts": {
            "default": 0,
            "title": "Ts",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "robot_id",
          "status_code",
          "battery_pct",
          "max_joint_temp",
          "joint_temperatures",
          "joint_positions",
          "joint_torques"
        ],
        "title": "RobotTelemetryOut",
        "type": "object"
      },
