    "/healthz": {
      "get": {
        "description": "健康检查。\n\n`status` 反映**依赖可达性**，不只是「进程活着」：\n- `ok`       —— DB 与 Redis 都可达\n- `degraded` —— 进程活着但依赖不可达（此时写入会堆积到队列，需立刻告警）\n- 仍返回 HTTP 200：这是**存活探针**语义，改为 503 会让容器被重启掉，\n  而依赖恢复后本服务能自愈，重启反而丢在飞数据。依赖不健康由 `status` 字段表达。",
        "operationId": "healthz_healthz_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Healthz"
      }
    },
    "/metrics": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Prometheus 抓取端点（`infra/observability/prometheus.yml` 的 `robot_backend` job）。\n\n与 `/healthz` 的区别是**模型**而不是内容：`/healthz` 回瞬时快照，\n抓取端拿到的永远是\"上一次写入那一刻\"的值；这里的 Counter 是单调累加的，\nPrometheus 才能算出 `rate()` / `increase()`，让 1000 msg/s 有历史曲线。\n\n函数名**不能叫 `metrics`** —— 那会遮蔽模块名 `app.metrics`（`from app import metrics`）。",
        "operationId": "prometheus_metrics_metrics_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Prometheus Metrics"
      }
    },
